"P4141979918" "We've been able to pin-point the location of the Sky Raider's fall-back point using the information you discovered in the Sky Raider attack on Paradyne labs. We think that they're lying low there until they can get Dr. Winslowe and his device out of the country. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Sky Raiders aren't going to give him and his machine up without a fight, but this could be the last chance to save Dr. Winslowe and get his machine out of the Sky Raider's hands.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3545374708" "Strike Sky Raider fall-back point to rescue Dr. Winslowe"
