// Dialog :
"P1717849647" "You have brought an end to the threat of the Cosmotron, and got Dr. Winslowe home safely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2730845013" "The threat of the Cosmotron is over. Dr. Winslowe has apologized to the families of the Kheldians accidentally slain by the device, and is trying to make amends as best he can. There are still a number of questions, though. Swann mentioned that there were others within the Council that were out to purge both Arakhn's and Requiem's factions, and we weren't too much farther down their list. What are their plans? We may have to wait until another clue comes our way to find out and unravel this new mystery. <br><br>You should seek to improve your already considerable skills until then. Talk to me again when you're around level 25. I have a feeling that by the time you reach that point, we'll be ready for the next step."
// RandomFameString :
"P2018403424" "I heard that Paradyne's Dr. Winslowe was working on a new project. Hope he has better luck than with that Cosmowhatsit doohicky."

